// page sends and reads, are their camelCase forms. Byte values are strings
// of base64url without padding, and enum values are SCREAMING_SNAKE_CASE
// strings, as in the rest of the contract. Integer fields are 32-bit, so
// proto3 JSON writes them as numbers. Proto3 JSON leaves out a field at its
// default value: an absent field is false, 0, empty or an empty list.

